window.products.push({"id":571124,"name":"Amposei Static Cling Frosted Round Design Decorative Privacy Window Wilm for Bedroom Glassdoor 17.7 by 78.7 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I4yGh8s0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Decorate any clear glass window/wall into a stylish screen with this stripe etched glass film, ideal for windows that are not well suited for curtains or blinds. This film also protect carpet and upholstery from fading due to UV rays without light blocking. Easy to install and remove to smooth glass with no adhesives. Innovative solution for privacy and decor. Fit a variety of applications, for office, meeting room, school, stores, home and so on. Instruction: 1.Measure the size of your window. Cute the film into proper size, approximately 1 inch larger; 2.Clean your window thoroughly; 3.Wet the window completely(better with low-concentration soapy water); 4.Peel off the backing clear protective film gently; 5.Position the film against the window and press across the entire film to allow it grip slightly; 6.Smooth out the film with squeegee, make sure there is no air bubbles and water inside; 7.Dry off your window with a rag entirely, cut the excessive edge carefully. Q&A : Q:How long will this film last for? A:In normal condition, it will last for 2 year on the window. Q:Why there is bubbles inside? A:Because the water is not clean out entirly. After you position the film, please smooth out the film with squeegee, make the air bubbles and water out completely. Q:Could this film be used for more than one times? A:Yes, but the stickup side of the film must be completely clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I4yGh8s0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amposei","source_asin":"B01FLVKOD0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FLVKOD0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FLVKOD0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
