window.products.push({"id":571168,"name":"Laura Ashley Home Kenna Collection Quilt Set-100% Cotton, Reversible, Lightweight Bedding with Matching Sham(s), Pre-Washed for Added Softness, Twin, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o-sywk91L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This soft, pre-washed cotton quilt set brings together a medley of small-scale floral prints in a classic block pieced patchwork to create a charming cottage look that works anywhere. The fresh, monotone palette of blue and white along with thin, horizontal channel quilting gives a modern edge to this airy mix of vintage prints. The quilt reverses to one of the coordinate print components that also trims the edges of the quilt and shams for a clean, tailored finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91o-sywk91L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B088LGTWT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LGTWT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LGTWT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":571169,"name":"Endless Esthetiques - Aromatic Incense Sticks | Meditation, Yoga, Aromatherapy, Cleansing, Smudging, Relaxation, Intention-Setting, Home Fragrance, St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513sES1UplL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"PURPOSE: Our Incense Sticks are widely used in yoga, meditation, massage, spas, etc. Our incense can make you feel happy and relaxed, Reduces Anxiety and stress level, and makes your soul feel fresh and fulfilled with positive energy. Best used for clearing energy blockages within and in your surrounding environment, intention setting, manifestation, and meditation. LONG LASTING & CLEAN BURNING: Our Endless Esthetiques Incense sticks are long in length and are durable to burn for a long time, no need to relight again and again. Just enjoy each stick for a long time and stay lit to the end amazingly. Endless Esthetiques Incense sticks are made of Non-toxic fumes and fills your surroundings with a delightful and sweet fragrance. Add these to your environment for an energetic reset. NATURAL INGREDIENTS: Our Incense Sticks are made of Non-Toxic and harmful Ingredients. All of our incenses are made with 100% natural Ingredients with absolutely all pure and organic Ingredients Including essential oils, herbs, and wood gums. HAND DIPPED INCENSE STICKS: Our Aromatic Incense Stick each bundle is dipped in our own fragrance oils at a high level of ratio to make sure the fragrance solidity on each stick is as durable and effective as possible. GREAT FOR SELF-CARE PRACTICE: Create a space of openness and oneness. Be inspired to meditate, pray, set intentions, manifest your greatest desires, feel love, grace, and mercy for yourself and others even if it feels undeserving. Reflect your inner light. Feel happy, healthy, and free. Find forgiveness and release any feelings stemming from the ego. PROMOTES HEALTHY MIND, BODY, SOUL: Our incenses are the perfect tool for relaxation, Meditation, Yoga, Aromatherapy, intention-setting, chakra balancing, healing and for creating an all-around good karma atmosphere. It promotes the health of body, mind and refreshes the soul. Clear your mind from all chaotic vibrations and find peace, serenity, and tranquility. Harmonize energies to create room for tranquility and peace. Release worry, stress and anxiety. HOW TO USE: Hold the bundle at a 45-degree point and light with a lighter or matchbox. Let it burn for a few seconds and gently blow it out. Gesture the smoke around your home, office, or your surroundings to clear negative energies and invite peace into the space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513sES1UplL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Endless Esthetiques","source_asin":"B09JPC95DG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JPC95DG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JPC95DG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
