window.products.push({"id":571320,"name":"ORNISA Embroidered Sheet Set Full Size 100% Cotton 4 Piece Sateen Weave White Bedsheet Set Softest Premium Luxury High end Hotel Collection Bedding Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GS8o5uDyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing beats a comfortable and cozy pair of luxury sheets when it’s bedtime. With proper care, a good pair of fine sheets can last from 5 to 10 years CORDOBA DESIGN – Cool and crisp, tailored sheets that graces the finest hotels in the world, our best-selling sateen weave bedding has an accented border on the pillowcases that creates a five-star, hotel-quality sheet set. Why Sateen over other fabrics? Cool and crisp bed sheets; crafted in India from 100% premium, cotton is perfect for hot sleepers. Sateen Bed sheets will make you feel like snuggling up in luxury every single night.   - Soft, Crisp, Lightweight Fabric for everyday use. - Stay warm and cozy without getting too hot. - Soft, flexible, and breathable for maximum sleep comfort  - Long-Lasting Bed Sheet for long-lasting comfort. Easy Care for Cotton Bed Sheet 1. You may use your washing machine or have these Sateen Bedsheets professionally laundered.  2. Never use bleach for Cotton Bed Sheets – it weakens the cotton fibers.  3. Set the dryer to low heat, as overheating causes the fibers to become brittle and the color to fade. Reduce static and soften your bedding by adding Wool Dryer Balls to the drying cycle.  4. Unlike many bedding brands, we don't use any artificial substances in our sheets, so like any 100% cotton product, your Organic sheets will naturally wrinkle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GS8o5uDyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORNISA","source_asin":"B0BRZ9YY8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRZ9YY8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRZ9YY8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
