window.products.push({"id":571387,"name":"Carolina Creekhouse Isabella FloorFlat (042098UA) | Decorative Vinyl Floor Covering | Lay Flat | Durable | No Curling Edges | Waterproof | Easy Clean ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ze6iwJL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WELCOMING STYLE Embellish your home with the intricate pattern in our Isabella FloorFlat. Mat features a green design arrangement against a white backdrop. This ornamental design matches your welcoming personality and home decor-style while at the same time protecting your precious floors. Our 2’ x 3’ mat is the ideal size in front of your kitchen or bathroom sink, outside under the covered front or back patio door, and more. BENEFITS OF FLOOR FLATS Our FloorFlats have been developed by design to lay flat on any hard surface floor (not recommended for carpet). Resting flush with your flooring, our low profile 1.5mm flats prevent doors from catching on the mat while opening and closing. The no slip bottom eliminates the need for an additional pad underneath. The edges of the mat never curl so no need to worry about tripping or falling. Plus, these mats unroll flat the first time so you can begin using immediately. DURABLE AND RESISTANT Thin, premium matte vinyl mats protect your floors from spills, scratches, abrasions, and the wear-and-tear of daily use. Spruce up the high traffic spaces in your home without the costly expense of new floors. Our mats are suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor patios. The decorative pattern and dynamic colors provide aesthetic appeal that will continue to please over the years. EASY TO CLEAN Our low maintenance FloorFlats are easy to clean plus stain and fade resistant. These waterproof mats offer trouble-free cleaning in just seconds! Simply wipe with soapy water for a just-like-new finish. Spills, dirt, pet messes – no worries! FloorFlats will quickly become your go-to-solution in many areas of your home. PATRIOTIC AND RESPONSIBLE Our FloorFlats are proudly made in the USA. Your family’s safety is of upmost importance so feel comfortable knowing our materials are eco-friendly and non-toxic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ze6iwJL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carolina Creekhouse","source_asin":"B08X7FV586","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X7FV586","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X7FV586","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":571388,"name":"Artdix Cordless Roman Shades Window Blinds - Yellow 34 W x 60L Inches Lined Fabric Custom Geometric Roman Shades Blinds for Windows, Doors, French Doo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rOsAMhuYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"①BLACKOUT LINED ROMAN SHADE: The geometric roman shades are highly functional and just a bit casual, our custom fabric Roman Shades ensure that the windows themselves are part of the view. The blackout lined roman shades are constructed with 2 layers fabric, beige liner backing, make the roman blinds to keep out 100% SUNLIGHT and UV RAY. No chemical coating, safe to environment. Ideal use for windows, doors, French door, sliding doors, kitchen, bedroom. Machine or hand washable. Tumble dry. ② CONFIRM ORDER IN 24 HRS: We will send a confirmation email within 24 hrs. We can change color and tiny size adjustment for free. The sooner you reply, the sooner you get the roman shade. HARDWARE INCLUDED: The hardware and lift mechanism will be sent together with the roman blind. The pull bead is installed by default on the right. If you need left installed, please send message to us in 24 hrs. You can also call or text us: (929)300-3678 ③ INSIDE MOUNT: For inside mounting, the roman shade width needs to be 0.4 inch less than your window inside width for fitting, at least 2 inches window depth is required for inside mount. For example, if the window inside width and length is 30.2\"Wx72\"H, the roman shade size should be 29.8\"Wx72\"L. You can choose 30\"W*72\"L to place order then email us your window size and demand inside mount. ④ OUTSIDE MOUNT: For outside mounting, roman shade width and length need to be 3-10 inches larger than your window width and length for better covering, if there is enough space the bigger the better. For example, if the window width and length is 30.2\"Wx64\"H, we suggest the roman shade size to be 36\"Wx72\"L. You can choose 36\"Wx72\"L to place order. ⑤ Contact Us: Please contact us if have any problem after receiving the products. We can solve any problem together with you. MADE TO ORDER: We provide custom service without extra charge. Please see below about how to get a custom roman shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rOsAMhuYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artdix","source_asin":"B08B3FVYP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3FVYP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3FVYP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
