window.products.push({"id":571495,"name":"Incense Burner Handmade Traditional Incense Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iyKdxyMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The incense stick burner is perfect for your incense sticks or incense cones and protects your furniture when burning incense. It's very easy to use by simply placing your incense on holder. After lighting your incense enjoy the relaxing aromas of your favorite incense as it drifts gently around your room. Beautifully carved handmade by the skilled local artisans and underprivileged women of India. Hand Crafted Sheesham Wood. The eye-catching motif has been hand worked with passion and attention to detail. Use incense for meditation: Burning incense during meditation can not only help relax your mind, but it can also help give you a sense of focus. Use incense as an air freshener: Because incense produces a lot of fragrant smoke, it is possible to use this as an air freshener. Keep in mind, however, that incense will only mask odors, and that to eliminate a bad smell completely, you will have to get rid of the source (be it the trash, dirty dishes, dirty litter, and so forth). Use incense for aromatherapy: You can use incense to help you focus, increase motivation, ease headaches, and reduce depression. Burning incense may also help you relax and feel less stressed. Please Note: This Product has been meticulously hand-crafted by artisans in India, one piece at a time. As each piece is unique you may notice slight variation. These characteristics make this piece truly one-of-a-kind. As a natural result of the manufacturing process, products can feature small irregularities and cracks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iyKdxyMWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The","source_asin":"B07SYY7S4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SYY7S4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SYY7S4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
