window.products.push({"id":571628,"name":"MAITREYA Advent Purple Candles Conical Stick Candles Spiral Taper Candles-Set of 4 for Decoration Weddings Party Church-Unscented Dripless Candles,10i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gY3sCreLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET THE MOOD -A Set of 4 Unscented Spiral Taper Candles Made of High-Quality Paraffin Wax. : These tall tapered candles feature an elegant design that is suitable for restaurants, special events and parties. Their elegant look complements almost any decor. Long Lasting Burning Hours - Our dripless Taper candles burn up to 10-12 hours continuously. The long candles contain 100% pure cotton wicks to improve the burning process. These are best slow burning Candles for church and candlelight service. Packing and Dimensions of Candles – Each Set of 4 Spiral Taper candles comes in beautiful，environmentally friendly Packing.Each of Taper candle is 0.8 Inches and height is 10 inches with pure 100% cotton wick which gives the perfect shine and elegant look. PERFECT GIFT- MAITREYA Taper Candles are an ideal gift for birthdays, Christmas, anniversaries, Valentines Mother's Day and Father's Day, or just to express gratitude to anyone. Make an unforgettable valentine day candlelight dinner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gY3sCreLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAITREYA","source_asin":"B0B76PV5MV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B76PV5MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B76PV5MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":571629,"name":"PackIt Freezable Classic Lunch Box, Gray Venom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9TLoAfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The old-school lunchbox is getting PackIt's cool twist! PackIt's Fully Freezable Lunch Box is the only lunchbox with built-in cooling that chills food and drinks for hours. The secret is PackIt's groundbreaking technology: a freezable non-toxic gel liner is integrated into the walls of the lunch box. The design totally eliminates the need for separate ice packs or gel packs! To use, simply flatten the lunch box and place it in the freezer overnight (12 hours for optimal results). In the morning, the walls of the lunch box will be completely frozen and ready to chill. With fully frozen walls, this lunchbox keeps food cooler longer, which means you can pack healthier foods that would spoil in other lunch boxes such as: dairy, deli meats, salads, fruits and veggies. The Classic Freezable Lunch Box by PackIt easily fits an entire meal and a 12 ounce (340ml) drink. A top-load design makes this lunch box simple to pack, and its kid-friendly zipper closure locks in cold, dry air. A slim exterior zip pocket is perfect for lunchbox notes, ID cards, napkins or wipes. A buckle handle lets you clip the lunchbox onto totes, backpacks or sports bags. PackIt's Classic Lunchbox is made with nontoxic gel and gel liner. Like all PackIt products, the Classic Lunchbox is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. Care: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe. PackIt's Classic Freezable Lunch Box measures 8.25 inches tall standing upright, 10 inches wide from side to side and 4.25 inches front to back/deep. When collapsed for freezing, it measures a slim 8.5 by 10 by 2.25 inches for easy storage in the freezer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f9TLoAfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B08QRLYLV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QRLYLV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QRLYLV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
