window.products.push({"id":571661,"name":"Tea Kettle Whistling Teapot for Stovetop : 2.64 Quart Food Grade Stainless Steel Tea Pot with Wood Pattern Handle, Loud Whistle Kettle for Tea, Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UjRuY1o1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎶Perfect Whistling Sound: The loud & automatical whistling lets you can hear it from another room when the water is boiling. Reduce the safety hazards and prevent you from forgetting to turn off the stovetop and causing the water to be boiled dry. Also 2.64-quart boiling water capacity can meets your whole family's drinking needs 🍵85 OZ / 2.5 Liter Capacity: This small tea kettle is very suitable for families or parties of 4-5 people. The 2.5 Liter capacity allows you to reach a capacity of about 10 cups after a single boil, which making you no need to repeatedly boil water frequently and saving your time. Enjoy your breakfast or tea time happily.( NOTE: Please make sure that the water level is below the water outlet of the kettle to ensure that the whistle is working properly. ) 🍵Innovative Bottom Boils Water Faster:Our whistling tea pot is designed according to the principle of thermal circulation, 3-layer thicked heating base(stainless steel, aluminum, 304 stainless steel) ensures fast heating, evenly distributes heat along the bottom,sides and body of the kettle to ensure water completely boiling,shortening waiting time 🍵Suitable for Various Stovetops: AMFOCUS stainless steel tea kettle is comatible with various heat sources, including induction, gas, electric, halogen and radiant cooktops. Please keep it dry after you use it to prolong tea kettles service lifetime 🍵Ergonomical Handle & Simple-Press Spout: The silicone-coated insulated handle allows you to lift the tea pot directly without risk of burns. The ergonomic shape & soft silicone material increase the comfort when lifting or pouring water. In addtion, the user-friendly spout is easy to turn on/off, and the metal piece is safe to touch the air or water, also prevents the water leaking. Black color with elegant shape, this teakettle is an indispensable decoration in your kitchen 🌟Warm Tips: Since our stovetop kettle is made of stainless steel, A HIGH FIRE can overheat it and make it impossible to touch directly. To protect your kettle, recommend to use low to middle fire when boiling water on the gas stoves to get a longer service life. It's a normal phenomenon and can be removed if stainless steel teapot appears \"rust\" or limescale inside of the kettle. If you meet any problems, please contact us and we will help to fix your problems ASAP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UjRuY1o1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMFOCUS","source_asin":"B0B946PRT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B946PRT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B946PRT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
