window.products.push({"id":571680,"name":"SMARTRO ST59 Digital Meat Thermometer for Oven BBQ Grill Kitchen Food Cooking with 1 Probe and Timer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t-Yde9iSL._AC_.jpg","description":"🌟【TOUCH SCREEN & LCD BACKLIT】Sensitive touchscreen design makes the digital meat thermometer easier to operate. It has a backlit LCD displays which make it convenient to use at night and helps you get a quick reading at a glance from any angle. 🌟【MEET THE TASTES FOR YOUR WHOLE FAMILY】The oven thermometer is pre-programmed with temperatures for 8 types of meat(BEEF, LAMB, VEAL, HAMBURGER, PORK, TURKEY, CHICK, FISH)and their various degrees of doneness(WELL, MED WELL, MEDIUM, MED RARE, RARE)recommended by the USDA. Additionally, you can also set the temperatures according to your personal tastes. Make the most delicious turkey on Thanksgiving with this meat probe thermometer. 🌟【TAKE THE STRESS OUT OF OVER COOKING】The food thermometer comes with a built-in timer with a \"count down\" function, allowing you to set up to maximum time of 99 minutes and 59 seconds for your cooking time. When the time is up or the probe reaches to a set temperature, the alarm will beep. It is perfect for, BBQ, baking, roasting, frying, candy, chocolate or other cold dishes. 🌟【LONG AND ACCURATE PROBE】6.7 inches long collapsible probe keeps you from burning yours hands while measuring. The BBQ grilling oven probe can endure from -4°F (-20°C) to 482°F (250°C) .We do not recommend that using this leave-in-probe for high heating grilling, because flare-ups in high heating grilling can exceed 1,000°F which can damage probe. If still use it, separate probe and cable from flare-ups, grill lids, grill grates or other hot spots with high temperature over 482°F. 🌟【GREAT CONVENIENCE FOR YOU】With two STRONG MAGNETS and a STAND on the back, this grill thermometer can be attached on the fridge, oven or be put on the table with a stand. With this instant read thermometer you may cook like a professional chef on Christmas - set the meat type, the level of cooking required, and then wait for the alarm to say dinner is ready!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t-Yde9iSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMARTRO","source_asin":"B07DK6RW62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DK6RW62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DK6RW62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
