window.products.push({"id":571798,"name":"SALE! 16\" Hand Made Metal Iron Wall Medallion, Wall, Home, Room Decoration, Home Decor 100% Lead Free Paint, Bronze Color. Gift yourself or a LOVED on","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IY+wUO3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With this exquisite, unique, antique looking medallion you may enhance your room, hallway, kitchen, bathroom, stairway, den, patio or any area that needs an uplift. This hand made piece is guaranteed to satisfy your needs and give the place a nice, eye-catching effect. Bronze color - made of 100% lead free paint for your safety. Easy to hang - no assembly required - 16\" width by 16\" height. Hanging loop in back - screw will not be seen when hanging. Durable, Top quality, metal construction will provide years of use. Great GIFT idea for any age!! Avoid the hassle of hand delivering your gift. Ship it directly to your recipient!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IY+wUO3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BindMaster","source_asin":"B075XJ1DGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075XJ1DGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075XJ1DGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":571799,"name":"Crock-Pot 4 Qt Programmable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8n4hDrSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Treat your busy family to a delicious home-cooked meal every night with the Crock-Pot Smart-Pot Black Oval Programmable Slow Cooker from Sunbeam. Made of durable, removable and oval stoneware with a glass lid and plastic handles, this slow cooker is designed to hold up to the wear and tear of busy kitchens and demanding recipes. It boasts an impressive four-quart capacity for easily serving at least four people, making it an ideal vessel for serving up nutritious, wholesome and satisfying meals the whole family will love. Here’s what makes the slow cooker perfect for busy households: programmable cook settings. With these programmable cook settings, you can set the slow cooker on high with four or six-hour selections, and low with eight or 10-hour selections in order to meet the needs of your family’s hectic schedule. You can even set and forget about your meal thanks to the automatic shift to warm setting, which keeps your food at just the right serving temperature whenever you’re ready for it. And there’s still more this slow cooker has to offer, like a flat digital panel for easy reading and use, one-touch digital controls, and a dishwasher-safe stoneware and glass lid for stress-free cleaning. The Crock-Pot Smart-Pot Black Oval Programmable Slow Cooker from Sunbeam measures 9.4-inches high by 13.8-inches wide by 9.8-inches deep, comes in a sleek and sophisticated black exterior with black accents for seamless blending in any kitchen space, and includes recipes to help inspire your inner chef. Who needs takeout when you’ve got a Crock-Pot Smart-Pot Black Oval Programmable Slow Cooker?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8n4hDrSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crock-Pot","source_asin":"B00PXZQE5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PXZQE5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PXZQE5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
