window.products.push({"id":571885,"name":"Fahrendom Summer Nautical Gnome Decorative Throw Pillow Cover 18 x 18 Set of 4, Anchor Sailboat Coastal Beach Porch Patio Outdoor Home Decors Cushion ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wQUF4bcEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Linen Material: These 4 PCS blue gnome watercolor striped nautical style pillow covers are made of high-quality cotton and linen material which are soft and skin-friendly, sturdy and stylish. And when stuffed into the pillow core, it will be more plump and beautiful. This fabric can be washed by hand or machine and stay the same and as new after every wash Easy To Use: The invisible and hidden design of the zipper closure with coordinated color make an elegant look for the sayings pillow cover that is super easy to cram your pillow and filler into this summer pillow case, which also is very convenient to disassemble and clean Attractive Design: This beach gnome ocean series of 4-piece quotes pillowcase is designed with gnome, sailboat, anchors and starfish. These sayings pillowcases are also printed with quotes such as hope anchors the soul, let your dream set sail sign. They are very suitable for decorating the inside of your room in summer, or other seasons and holidays, and also perfect for decorating outside the house such as courtyard porches Application: These 4 packs phrase nautical gnome pillow covers are appropriate for decorating houses during summer. Perfectly matching with your indoor and outdoor home, you can use them to decorate your bed, fire place, sofa, bed, car to add more warm atmosphere Ideal gift choice: These sea-themed four pieces pillowcases are perfect gifts for friends and relatives in summer, applied to the summer atmosphere. These pillowcases can not only be given as holiday gifts to someone, but also to friends, family and teachers to express your love","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wQUF4bcEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fahrendom","source_asin":"B09SLJ1KFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-571885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SLJ1KFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SLJ1KFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
